ure message would be:\n```java\nTreeSet\u003c?\u003e set \u003d new TreeSet\u003c\u003e((List\u003c?\u003e) BlockUtils.toJavaObject(result, 0));\nassertThat(\"Missing expected values\", set.containsAll(Arrays.asList(values)), is(true));\n```\nThis avoids the inverted `if` + nested assertion pattern, which is harder to read and makes the pass/fail semantics less obvious.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesLongGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesLongGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java--2139:2379","promptId":"#E5PBT","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesLongGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesLongGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2139,"endPos":2379,"startLine":54,"startLineOffset":23,"endLine":59,"endLineOffset":13,"length":241}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesIntGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesIntGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java--2137:2377","promptId":"#B7N6C","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesIntGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesIntGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2137,"endPos":2377,"startLine":54,"startLineOffset":23,"endLine":59,"endLineOffset":13,"length":241}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggregation/ValuesDoubleGroupingAggregatorFunctionTests.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/compute/src/test/java/org/elasticsearch/compute/aggre